> Dear all,
>
> I need to predict() factor scores to use in another software. All runs
> fine except that the variance of the predicted factor tends to be lower
> than the model estimate. Even in CFA when the model variance is fixed to
> 1, the predicted score variance is less than 1 (0.7 in the example
