On 07/26/2014 03:42 AM, Lakshika Nawarathna wrote:
> Thank for your reply. These error variances depend on the bstar.
>
> We proposed this model to deal with heteroscedastic error variances. We
> can develop this model using R. But if we can do this using lavann, more
